{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/ng169onX/status/2103183904563998809","id":"2103183904563998809","text":"Opus 5.5 can now make animated explainer videos end to end, in a style similar to 3Blue1Brown.\n\nI gave it one short prompt. \n\nA few minutes later, it produced a 5-minute video on VAEs with:\n\n- Manim animations and math\n- Models actually trained on MNIST, so every digit shown is real\n- Cloned human narration using Qwen3-TTS on MLX\n- Original background music\n\nThis changes how technical topics can be explained. A concept or research paper can go from a single prompt to a full video walkthrough.\n\nInsane 🤯","raw_text":{"text":"Opus 5.5 can now make animated explainer videos end to end, in a style similar to 3Blue1Brown.\n\nI gave it one short prompt. \n\nA few minutes later, it produced a 5-minute video on VAEs with:\n\n- Manim animations and math\n- Models actually trained on MNIST, so every digit shown is real\n- Cloned human narration using Qwen3-TTS on MLX\n- Original background music\n\nThis changes how technical topics can be explained. A concept or research paper can go from a single prompt to a full video walkthrough.\n\nInsane 🤯","display_text_range":[0,508],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[279,302],"id":"2103183795109462016","display":"pic.x.com/nFQyQ1n2hG","original":"https://t.co/nFQyQ1n2hG","replacement":"https://x.com/ng169onX/status/2103183904563998809/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"ng169onX","url":"https://x.com/ng169onX","id":"1445782628624261133","followers":195,"following":334,"likes":5572,"media_count":62,"name":"Akshay K","description":"23, AI Engineer, Polyglot\nTeaching machines to think so i don't have to \nWill trade unsolicited CS lectures for GPU credits","raw_description":{"text":"23, AI Engineer, Polyglot\nTeaching machines to think so i don't have to \nWill trade unsolicited CS lectures for GPU credits","facets":[]},"location":"Bengaluru, Karnataka, India","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com